            <div xml:id="d613">

                <pb facs="0596" n="506" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg506"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2409</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Murmansk</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-08-03T22:00:00+04:31"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3, 1918,
                                10 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 4, 5.05 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>345. Local Soviet Archangel deposed yesterday with no casualties, so reported by
                        Chaplin, Russian officer commanding anti-Bolshevik
                    forces Archangel, to local agents commissaire Murmansk; Murman Soviet renounced
                    allegiance to central Soviet about six weeks ago. Reported unofficially to-day
                    that Allied forces landed Archangel not only without opposition but were
                    welcomed by people with <pb facs="0597" n="507" xml:id="pg507"/> flowers and
                    cheers. Trying to establish communication with Poole preparatory for a conference to learn his instructions and
                    plans. Probably return to Kandalaksha to-morrow with Italian and British chiefs
                    of mission.</p>
                <p>Understood that Chaplin represents Social Revolutionary
                    government, right and left, also Cadets and Octobrists and Monarchists who have
                    formed organization and designated it “Center,” whose bond of union is
                    opposition to Bolshevism.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Francis</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
